---
import { link } from '../lib/site';
---
<section class="profile" aria-label="공식노트 소개">
  <div class="profile-avatar" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M50 10 L62.5 36 L91 40 L70 60 L75.5 89 L50 75 L24.5 89 L30 60 L9 40 L37.5 36 Z" fill="#F7C94B" stroke="#E6B63F" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="profile-details">
    <h1>디스푸레 공식노트</h1>
    <p class="profile-byline">FlowSoftLabs · DISPURE</p>
    <p class="profile-description">굿즈 수집, 최애 기록, 앱 사용법과 디스푸레를 만드는 이야기를 전합니다.</p>
    <div class="profile-actions">
      <a href={link('about/')}>앱 소개 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
